1
00:02:31,017 --> 00:02:37,017
It's been two years since the War of the Best in Marineford.

2
00:02:37,017 --> 00:02:40,017
Scattered across the world, Luffy and his crew underwent special training

3
00:02:40,017 --> 00:02:42,017
to prepare for the trials ahead.

4
00:02:42,017 --> 00:02:44,017
Now, they return to the Sabaody Archipelago

5
00:02:44,017 --> 00:02:48,017
and move forward to the next stage of their journey, the New World.

6
00:02:56,017 --> 00:02:59,017
We aren't getting ready to take off, are we?

7
00:02:59,017 --> 00:03:01,017
We're still missing half the crew here.

8
00:03:01,017 --> 00:03:04,017
I mean, did Luffy even make it to the Archipelago yet?

9
00:03:04,017 --> 00:03:06,017
It's all under control.

10
00:03:06,017 --> 00:03:12,017
Captain! Huh? He's a friend of the crew, if you follow. Say hi.

11
00:03:12,017 --> 00:03:16,017
In other words, Luffy arrived earlier this morning.

12
00:03:16,017 --> 00:03:19,017
I gave Sanji a baby transponder snail when he stopped by,

13
00:03:19,017 --> 00:03:22,017
so I'll tell him to come back. You should have Zoro with him, too.

14
00:03:22,017 --> 00:03:25,017
Fine! You wanna fight me?

15
00:03:25,017 --> 00:03:28,017
I've trained these legs on the shores of hell for two years!

16
00:03:28,017 --> 00:03:31,017
Then you better use him to run, cause I will cut you in half!

17
00:03:34,017 --> 00:03:36,017
Good. We should hurry.

18
00:03:36,017 --> 00:03:40,017
Because any moment now, the Navy will be attacking with a sizable force.

19
00:03:40,017 --> 00:03:43,017
Unfortunately, there's no way to contact your captain.

20
00:03:44,017 --> 00:03:47,017
But if you follow this Vivre card, you should be able to hunt him down.

21
00:03:47,017 --> 00:03:50,017
Let's hope the fake straw hats buy you a bit of time.

22
00:03:50,017 --> 00:03:53,017
Grove 42 is on the outskirts, so it's close to the sea.

23
00:03:53,017 --> 00:03:57,017
Take the sunny there and be ready to depart on a moment's notice.

24
00:03:57,017 --> 00:04:01,017
I'm sure you'd like to relax after these two difficult years, but it wasn't meant to be.

25
00:04:01,017 --> 00:04:05,017
The winds of the new world wait for no one.

26
00:04:05,017 --> 00:04:18,017
The battle is on! Show them what you got from training!

27
00:04:18,017 --> 00:04:26,017
That should cover the basics at least, but read this before you set out.

28
00:04:26,017 --> 00:04:29,017
I doubt the coding will give you trouble, but better safe than sorry.

29
00:04:29,017 --> 00:04:31,017
Thanks for the tips. This should be fun.

30
00:04:31,017 --> 00:04:34,017
Do you guys think Luffy grew a big beard or big muscles or something?

31
00:04:34,017 --> 00:04:36,017
Oh man, I bet he looks cool now!

32
00:04:36,017 --> 00:04:38,017
I'm sure he does.

33
00:04:38,017 --> 00:04:41,017
Okay, enough talk. Let's head to Grove 42!

34
00:04:41,017 --> 00:04:44,017
Oh, right. Guess I better give Zoro and Sanji a call then.

35
00:04:44,017 --> 00:04:45,017
I'm worried though.

36
00:04:45,017 --> 00:04:46,017
Huh?

37
00:04:46,017 --> 00:04:50,017
Knowing Luffy, he's probably finding some way to get into trouble as we speak.

38
00:04:50,017 --> 00:04:55,017
It'll be our trouble soon enough. This is gonna be another wild ride, isn't it?

39
00:04:55,017 --> 00:04:59,017
Oh, I have an idea. Let me go pick him up. This will be good, I promise.

40
00:04:59,017 --> 00:05:06,017
If you don't get out of our way, we'll arrest every last one of you!

41
00:05:06,017 --> 00:05:10,017
I'd like to see you try. Just let the man play us rock and roll, dammit!

42
00:05:10,017 --> 00:05:12,017
Hey! What's going on over there?

43
00:05:12,017 --> 00:05:14,017
It's out of control, I'll tell you that much!

44
00:05:14,017 --> 00:05:18,017
The Navy came to arrest Soul King during his show when those fans are rioting!

45
00:05:18,017 --> 00:05:20,017
Looks like he made us escape though!

46
00:05:20,017 --> 00:05:24,017
You skinless traitor! I'm gonna make you pay!

47
00:05:24,017 --> 00:05:27,017
Anyway, that's not the big story here!

48
00:05:27,017 --> 00:05:30,017
Soul King is actually a pirate known as the Humming Swordsman!

49
00:05:30,017 --> 00:05:32,017
He's one of the Straw Hats!

50
00:05:38,017 --> 00:05:40,017
Thank you for the ride, my friend!

51
00:05:40,017 --> 00:05:43,017
And that was impeccable timing, I must say!

52
00:05:43,017 --> 00:05:45,017
You can thank Shockey for putting all this together!

53
00:05:45,017 --> 00:05:47,017
Your friends should be waiting for you at Grove 42!

54
00:05:47,017 --> 00:05:51,017
I'm so eager to see them again, my heart is beating out of my chest!

55
00:05:51,017 --> 00:05:54,017
Kidding! Obviously my chest is an empty void!

56
00:05:57,017 --> 00:06:07,017
Why are they even fighting?

57
00:06:07,017 --> 00:06:10,017
I don't know, but both of them are strong as heck!

58
00:06:10,017 --> 00:06:13,017
Still standing after all of that? Maybe you got stronger after all!

59
00:06:13,017 --> 00:06:16,017
Yeah, and your itty bitty baby attacks actually tickle a little now!

60
00:06:16,017 --> 00:06:19,017
Too bad they still don't hurt as bad as your food hurts my stomach!

61
00:06:19,017 --> 00:06:21,017
You're gonna fight about it!

62
00:06:26,017 --> 00:06:28,017
So here's the skinny, brother!

63
00:06:28,017 --> 00:06:29,017
Luffy's on the island!

64
00:06:29,017 --> 00:06:30,017
Somewhere!

65
00:06:30,017 --> 00:06:32,017
But the Navy's about to close in!

66
00:06:32,017 --> 00:06:34,017
And the rest of the crew is headed to Grove 42!

67
00:06:34,017 --> 00:06:35,017
Meet us there!

68
00:06:35,017 --> 00:06:36,017
Roger that, Frankie!

69
00:06:36,017 --> 00:06:37,017
Click!

70
00:06:37,017 --> 00:06:38,017
What's up?

71
00:06:38,017 --> 00:06:40,017
Great! You mean you weren't listening?

72
00:06:40,017 --> 00:06:42,017
Well, let's see...

73
00:06:42,017 --> 00:06:43,017
Navy!

74
00:06:43,017 --> 00:06:44,017
Come here!

75
00:06:44,017 --> 00:06:45,017
Us pirates!

76
00:06:45,017 --> 00:06:46,017
Ship!

77
00:06:46,017 --> 00:06:48,017
Run away!

78
00:06:48,017 --> 00:06:49,017
Is that clear enough?

79
00:06:49,017 --> 00:06:51,017
Why are you talking like that?

80
00:06:51,017 --> 00:06:53,017
Did you hit your head or something?

81
00:06:53,017 --> 00:06:54,017
Sorry.

82
00:06:54,017 --> 00:06:57,017
I just thought I'd speak on your level for once.

83
00:06:57,017 --> 00:06:58,017
Huh?

84
00:06:58,017 --> 00:06:59,017
Alright then!

85
00:06:59,017 --> 00:07:02,017
After this, stupid cook, die!

86
00:07:02,017 --> 00:07:03,017
Real funny.

87
00:07:03,017 --> 00:07:06,017
Anyway, you know what all that racket over there's about?

88
00:07:06,017 --> 00:07:07,017
Huh?

89
00:07:09,017 --> 00:07:10,017
You.

90
00:07:10,017 --> 00:07:11,017
Right.

91
00:07:11,017 --> 00:07:12,017
Noisy.

92
00:07:12,017 --> 00:07:13,017
There.

93
00:07:28,017 --> 00:07:29,017
Wow!

94
00:07:29,017 --> 00:07:31,017
These guys sure are worked up!

95
00:07:32,017 --> 00:07:34,017
Alright, that's enough yakking!

96
00:07:34,017 --> 00:07:35,017
Listen!

97
00:07:36,017 --> 00:07:40,017
Turns out Sansi and Zoro found one of the guys who insulted me!

98
00:07:40,017 --> 00:07:42,017
In fact, he's here with us right now!

99
00:07:43,017 --> 00:07:45,017
Look at this little punk!

100
00:07:45,017 --> 00:07:49,017
I'm gonna beat a lesson into him with my own two hands!

101
00:07:49,017 --> 00:07:52,017
Cause when you piss me off, then things get ugly!

102
00:07:53,017 --> 00:07:56,017
And let this be a lesson to all of you, too!

103
00:07:56,017 --> 00:07:59,017
If you ever cross me, if you ever disrespect me,

104
00:07:59,017 --> 00:08:01,017
you're gonna end up just like this chump!

105
00:08:01,017 --> 00:08:03,017
Don't forget who's the boss of this crew!

106
00:08:03,017 --> 00:08:05,017
Is that perfectly clear?

107
00:08:05,017 --> 00:08:06,017
Yeah!

108
00:08:07,017 --> 00:08:08,017
But you're in that bounty somehow,

109
00:08:08,017 --> 00:08:10,017
and it wasn't by playing Naisy Nights.

110
00:08:11,017 --> 00:08:12,017
What's with this guy?

111
00:08:12,017 --> 00:08:13,017
Zoro?

112
00:08:13,017 --> 00:08:14,017
Sanji?

113
00:08:14,017 --> 00:08:15,017
A friend of yours or something?

114
00:08:15,017 --> 00:08:17,017
I don't think he likes me.

115
00:08:18,017 --> 00:08:19,017
We've got you surrounded!

116
00:08:19,017 --> 00:08:21,017
Nobody move an inch!

117
00:08:21,017 --> 00:08:22,017
Straw Hat Luffy!

118
00:08:22,017 --> 00:08:24,017
You and the rest of your crew are under arrest!

119
00:08:24,017 --> 00:08:26,017
Surrender immediately!

120
00:08:26,017 --> 00:08:27,017
The Navy?

121
00:08:27,017 --> 00:08:29,017
And don't bother running away!

122
00:08:29,017 --> 00:08:31,017
We've blocked off every exit in Grove 46!

123
00:08:31,017 --> 00:08:33,017
You guys leave with us, or you're gonna leave in a body bag!

124
00:08:33,017 --> 00:08:35,017
But my disguise is perfect!

125
00:08:35,017 --> 00:08:37,017
How did the Navy know I was here?

126
00:08:37,017 --> 00:08:38,017
Why?

127
00:08:38,017 --> 00:08:39,017
Why would you think that this was about you?

128
00:08:39,017 --> 00:08:41,017
Captain, please tell me we're not all dead!

129
00:08:41,017 --> 00:08:42,017
Stop flipping out!

130
00:08:42,017 --> 00:08:43,017
We'll be just fine!

131
00:08:43,017 --> 00:08:46,017
Why do you think we recruited all these guys?

132
00:08:46,017 --> 00:08:48,017
We've got pirates with 100 million bounties here!

133
00:08:48,017 --> 00:08:49,017
But this is scary!

134
00:08:49,017 --> 00:08:51,017
Then sit back and watch!

135
00:08:53,017 --> 00:08:54,017
Caribou, you're up!

136
00:08:54,017 --> 00:08:57,017
Use that marine as a shield and make us a path out of this dump!

137
00:08:57,017 --> 00:08:58,017
Wait, what marine?

138
00:08:58,017 --> 00:09:02,017
We sent a scout here earlier that looks like he was taken captive!

139
00:09:02,017 --> 00:09:04,017
Dammit, that's not good!

140
00:09:04,017 --> 00:09:05,017
Huh?

141
00:09:05,017 --> 00:09:07,017
I didn't quite catch that one, boss!

142
00:09:07,017 --> 00:09:09,017
Wanna run it by me again?

143
00:09:09,017 --> 00:09:10,017
Get with the program!

144
00:09:10,017 --> 00:09:13,017
I said use the captive as a shield and get us out!

145
00:09:13,017 --> 00:09:14,017
What an interesting idea!

146
00:09:14,017 --> 00:09:19,017
You want me to put the poor sinner to use while we still can?

147
00:09:33,017 --> 00:09:35,017
What the hell are you doing, Caribou?

148
00:09:35,017 --> 00:09:36,017
We need him to escape!

149
00:09:36,017 --> 00:09:38,017
Did you even hear me?

150
00:09:39,017 --> 00:09:41,017
Although that would be terribly convenient,

151
00:09:41,017 --> 00:09:43,017
I'm afraid it simply won't do!

152
00:09:43,017 --> 00:09:44,017
Why not?

153
00:09:44,017 --> 00:09:47,017
Because he told me he hadn't called the Navy yet!

154
00:09:47,017 --> 00:09:50,017
And that makes him a filthy little liar!

155
00:09:52,017 --> 00:09:53,017
Caribou, no!

156
00:10:02,017 --> 00:10:04,017
That crazy bastard!

157
00:10:04,017 --> 00:10:06,017
Who's the captain here, dammit?

158
00:10:06,017 --> 00:10:09,017
Oh well, so much for that plan!

159
00:10:09,017 --> 00:10:15,017
You high and mighty types seem to think it's alright to lie to someone if they're a so-called bad guy!

160
00:10:15,017 --> 00:10:17,017
Would I object to that?

161
00:10:18,017 --> 00:10:20,017
I guess they're not surrendering, huh?

162
00:10:20,017 --> 00:10:22,017
Should've figured as much!

163
00:10:22,017 --> 00:10:24,017
George, show the pirates no mercy!

164
00:10:24,017 --> 00:10:25,017
No mercy!

165
00:10:25,017 --> 00:10:26,017
No!

166
00:10:26,017 --> 00:10:27,017
Good luck!

167
00:10:27,017 --> 00:10:29,017
Our boss is Straw Hat Luffy!

168
00:10:29,017 --> 00:10:31,017
He's not gonna lose to a bunch of chumps like you!

169
00:10:31,017 --> 00:10:32,017
Let's go!

170
00:10:36,017 --> 00:10:38,017
If you've got a plan, I'd hurry!

171
00:10:38,017 --> 00:10:39,017
Listen to your captain!

172
00:10:39,017 --> 00:10:41,017
You guys are pissing me off!

173
00:10:41,017 --> 00:10:45,017
The guy just said that I was his boss, but I've never even seen him before!

174
00:10:45,017 --> 00:10:47,017
I do not have time to deal with your nonsense right now!

175
00:10:59,017 --> 00:11:01,017
Aim for their captain in charge!

176
00:11:03,017 --> 00:11:04,017
I know you!

177
00:11:04,017 --> 00:11:06,017
You're lip service Doty!

178
00:11:06,017 --> 00:11:08,017
Your bounty's 88 million!

179
00:11:08,017 --> 00:11:12,017
You may be idiots, but at least you're not cowards!

180
00:11:12,017 --> 00:11:14,017
Don't let him intimidate you!

181
00:11:19,017 --> 00:11:20,017
Holy crap!

182
00:11:20,017 --> 00:11:22,017
He's got a bounty of 92 million!

183
00:11:22,017 --> 00:11:24,017
That's gashed Albion!

184
00:11:27,017 --> 00:11:28,017
We'll take him down!

185
00:11:28,017 --> 00:11:30,017
Justice is on our side!

186
00:11:32,017 --> 00:11:34,017
The ground is soaked with the blood of hypocrites!

187
00:11:34,017 --> 00:11:37,017
Its overwhelming stench makes me so sick!

188
00:11:37,017 --> 00:11:39,017
A 210 million bounty!

189
00:11:39,017 --> 00:11:40,017
Wet-haired caribou!

190
00:11:40,017 --> 00:11:41,017
Huh?

191
00:11:41,017 --> 00:11:43,017
Too late to surrender now!

192
00:11:44,017 --> 00:11:45,017
Oh!

193
00:11:45,017 --> 00:11:46,017
Dammit!

194
00:11:46,017 --> 00:11:47,017
No one said he had a devil fruit power!

195
00:11:49,017 --> 00:11:51,017
Why don't we all slow down a bit?

196
00:11:51,017 --> 00:11:54,017
Haven't you heard that stress can lead to an early grave?

197
00:11:56,017 --> 00:11:57,017
My sword!

198
00:12:01,017 --> 00:12:02,017
Those new recruits aren't half bad!

199
00:12:02,017 --> 00:12:04,017
We got this in a bag!

200
00:12:04,017 --> 00:12:06,017
I told you we'd be fine!

201
00:12:06,017 --> 00:12:07,017
Hey boys!

202
00:12:07,017 --> 00:12:08,017
I got a deal for ya!

203
00:12:08,017 --> 00:12:12,017
Or rather it's a contest to see who can kill the most marines before they run away in terror!

204
00:12:13,017 --> 00:12:15,017
Winner becomes my second mate!

205
00:12:16,017 --> 00:12:17,017
Make those bastards bleed!

206
00:12:17,017 --> 00:12:18,017
Yeah!

207
00:12:18,017 --> 00:12:20,017
What do you mean second mate?

208
00:12:20,017 --> 00:12:21,017
Yeah!

209
00:12:21,017 --> 00:12:22,017
What about us?

210
00:12:22,017 --> 00:12:25,017
I'd think of a way to make myself useful if I were you!

211
00:12:25,017 --> 00:12:27,017
We've got some real heavy hitters on the crew now!

212
00:12:27,017 --> 00:12:30,017
I might actually pull this pirate thing off!

213
00:12:30,017 --> 00:12:31,017
Ha ha ha ha!

214
00:12:36,017 --> 00:12:37,017
What?

215
00:12:37,017 --> 00:12:38,017
Pasa Vistas!

216
00:12:38,017 --> 00:12:39,017
Oh hell!

217
00:12:39,017 --> 00:12:48,017
Nobody told me they were gonna be here!

218
00:12:48,017 --> 00:12:54,017
I kinda wanna beat up those robot guys but Hancock said to stay out of trouble so I guess I won't!

219
00:12:54,017 --> 00:12:59,017
Those things that vaporize the mustache off your stupid face you nutbag!

220
00:13:05,017 --> 00:13:08,017
Monkey D. Luffy has been identified. Commence attack.

221
00:13:08,017 --> 00:13:12,017
Those things are aiming straight at me! Can I even run or am I just dead?

222
00:13:12,017 --> 00:13:16,017
I was hoping I'd get to rumble with them someday!

223
00:13:22,017 --> 00:13:27,017
Lip service Doty identified and subdued. Sustains no damage. Searching for next target.

224
00:13:28,017 --> 00:13:29,017
Captain Doty!

225
00:13:32,017 --> 00:13:35,017
Follow the Pasa Vistas! Capture every pirate in your path!

226
00:13:37,017 --> 00:13:38,017
Doty's that cold!

227
00:13:38,017 --> 00:13:41,017
A bounty like that and these guys took him down in only one shot?

228
00:13:41,017 --> 00:13:42,017
We're screwed!

229
00:13:43,017 --> 00:13:44,017
Hancock wait for us!

230
00:13:46,017 --> 00:13:50,017
I ain't waiting for nobody! The thing took out Doty! I don't see the chance!

231
00:13:56,017 --> 00:13:58,017
Straw Hat, do something! You're the only one who can stop him now!

232
00:14:00,017 --> 00:14:03,017
I hate to beg, Captain, but your whole crew is about to get blown up over here!

233
00:14:04,017 --> 00:14:05,017
There's nowhere left to run!

234
00:14:08,017 --> 00:14:09,017
Aw crap, he's gone!

235
00:14:09,017 --> 00:14:10,017
Where is Straw Hat?

236
00:14:12,017 --> 00:14:14,017
They keep calling for their captain, but...

237
00:14:14,017 --> 00:14:16,017
Go now you guys! My side is killing me!

238
00:14:16,017 --> 00:14:17,017
Go now you guys! My side is killing me!

239
00:14:17,017 --> 00:14:19,017
Go your side! The lasers are gonna kill you!

240
00:14:20,017 --> 00:14:22,017
Get your fat ass out of my way!

241
00:14:22,017 --> 00:14:24,017
Huh? Who is this idiot?

242
00:14:24,017 --> 00:14:25,017
Who is this idiot?

243
00:14:29,017 --> 00:14:30,017
He's here!

244
00:14:31,017 --> 00:14:32,017
Captain Luffy!

245
00:14:36,017 --> 00:14:37,017
This is gonna be good!

246
00:14:38,017 --> 00:14:39,017
You paying attention, Corbool?

247
00:14:40,017 --> 00:14:41,017
No! I was facing out!

248
00:14:42,017 --> 00:14:43,017
Over here, moron! Who are you bowing to it?

249
00:14:44,017 --> 00:14:45,017
Get up, Captain Luffy!

250
00:14:46,017 --> 00:14:47,017
Show him what you're made of!

251
00:14:47,017 --> 00:14:50,017
Would you look at that! Guess we don't have to die after all!

252
00:14:53,017 --> 00:14:56,017
Am I mistaken or did they call you Captain Luffy?

253
00:14:56,017 --> 00:15:00,017
Why wouldn't they call me that? I mean you realize who you're talking to right now, don't you?

254
00:15:00,017 --> 00:15:01,017
Go!

255
00:15:01,017 --> 00:15:04,017
Get out of my way before I grab your intestines and pull them out of your ear!

256
00:15:05,017 --> 00:15:06,017
I'd run if I were you!

257
00:15:06,017 --> 00:15:09,017
You're face to face with the son of Dragon the Revolutionary!

258
00:15:10,017 --> 00:15:12,017
That means I'm the grandson of the Hero Garp!

259
00:15:13,017 --> 00:15:15,017
I stare down the three admirals in the War of the Best!

260
00:15:16,017 --> 00:15:17,017
Oh, and my bounty?

261
00:15:18,017 --> 00:15:20,017
It clocks into 400 million berries!

262
